  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mirror power (1st level), Use Magic Device 3 Ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may now use mirror power to duplicate powers and spells generated by items of power. The item must have a Source you currently have learned for mirror power and the effect must be within your normal limits for mirror power. You must have an object in hand of similar size or nature (a loop of twine for a ring, a twig or dagger for a wand, etc.) Otherwise, this ability follows mirror power as per normal rules and uses one reflection.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
